  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: 'The classroom is once again only illuminated by the unusually bright moon.
      You stand there and try to think of a structured way to go at this. Eventually,
      you just give up and decide to just search the class for some clues. Yeah,
      best to start here and then make your way to the cafeteria. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 2
    text: "While you look around the classroom, you notice the arrival of a sleek
      black cat that wasn\u2019t there before. She only nods at you and then continues
      to doze in a loafing position. Right, maybe you could ask her for help if you
      find yourself stuck. Alright, then lets get this started! Let\u2019s check
      the room and then cross-reference with the clues you\u2019ve written down in
      your notebook."
    videoEventId: 
